WEBVTT

00:05:59.109 --> 00:06:04.222
And this vicious cycle goes on, goes on.

00:06:05.997 --> 00:06:08.524
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:06:08.524 --> 00:06:11.746
this plight of millions of women

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:14.578
could be changed

00:06:14.578 --> 00:06:16.953
if we think differently,

00:06:16.953 --> 00:06:20.934
if women and men think differently,

00:06:20.934 --> 00:06:25.152
if men and women in the
tribal and patriarchal societies

00:06:25.152 --> 00:06:27.135
in the developing countries,

00:06:27.135 --> 00:06:30.046
if they can break a few norms